#. Tag: programlisting
#: developers-plugins.docbook:457
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"void KisFilterInvert::process(KisPaintDeviceSP src, KisPaintDeviceSP dst,\n"
"                             KisFilterConfiguration* /*config*/, const "
